<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102397" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάπης</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>, ὁ</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>carpet, rug</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάπητα φέρεν μαλακοῦ ἐρίοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.124
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλαινάων . . οὔλων τε ταπήτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.224
				</span></i>
			; spread on seats and beds, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἷσεν δ᾽ ἐν κλισμοῖσι τάπησί τε
					πορφυρέοισιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					9.200
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				10.156
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				24.645
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.298
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				10.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Herod.
				2.44
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1106.121
			</span></i> (Cos, <span class="entity">iv/iii B.C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φορμὸν ἔχειν ἀντὶ τάπητος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					542
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάπης Αἰγύπτιος,
			Ἆφρος</span>, etc., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Edict.Diocl.</u>
				19.21
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				24
			</span></i>, al.--Later 
				Att.
			 forms are <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάπις, δάπις</span>
			(qq. v.).</div>
